A note on the tide, sun and moon calculations
---------------------------------------------

Moonfield is a teaching tool. Its outputs are approximations, and its tide
model in particular is explicitly not suitable for navigation or for any
decision where being wrong has consequences. Use an official hydrographic or
astronomical source for anything that matters.
